  {
   "id": "post-void-133149@major-2023-03-29",
   "gameId": "post-void-133149",
   "displayName": "POST VOID GAMEPAD UPDATE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-29T15:38:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're happy to announce the release of Post Void 1.4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This version of POST VOID adds some features that were created to the recently released console release of POST VOID.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "UPDATE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It seems this build was somehow crashing for a lot of players. We have temporarily reverted back to the older version, but will try to resolve this asap. For now, if you want to try the new version you can choose the public beta-branch to access it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Build is now live again and should not cause crashes anymore. Sorry for the inconvenience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "GAMEPAD SUPPORT",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "POST VOID now supports gamepad controls. We're very happy how the gamepad controls ended up and worked closely with porting developer Zach Reedy who did an amazing job with them. All buttons are rebindable and the game works perfectly on the Steam Deck. (Verification on deck should soon be approved, but it works very well already)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "LOCALIZATION",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New languages are now available in the options menu, the following languages are available:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "English",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "French",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spanish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dutch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Arabic",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian: Thanks to Super Rare games for letting us use the localization for the console version for STEAM.: Extra thanks to Isla Pleasure Partridge for the Russian translation and Malek Al-R. and Montassar Ghanmi for the Arabic localization.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "MONTHLY LEADERBOARDS",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As an extra little feature we decided to add Monthly leaderboards to POST VOID. These will be reset at the start of every month. Looking forward to compete with everyone for the top spots every month!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "IMPORTANT NOTES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This new version should run better overall as it's been optimized very well. You might, however, notice that the game will start with the tutorial again and you will need to re-apply any settings you've set in the old version, as the saves are handled differently.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't worry about your high-score though. As long as you've submitted to the leaderboard once, your game will load your high-score from the steam servers and set it locally. There is no way for your score to be overwritten on the main leaderboard.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Christopher & Josef",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
